# Multigamer `mgconfig.xml` (lab share)

On the **lab cabinet** share, multigamer config lives at:

`\\10.0.0.90\c$\Goldclub\slot\themes\mgconfig.xml`

Root element: `<Multigamer>…</Multigamer>`.

## Non-default setting to restore after upgrades

New or upgraded **slot/themes** drops may ship **without** this element. After deploying a new version, **re-insert** it if missing (values may vary; `0` was used to disable the timeout):

```xml
  <InactivitySecondsToGameSelector>0</InactivitySecondsToGameSelector>
```

Reasonable placement: as a sibling near other top-level UI settings, e.g. immediately after `<ShowAllLines>true</ShowAllLines>`.

When the user asks to update this file or fix game-selector inactivity behavior on that share, use the path above and verify the line is present.
